value\">$50</span><span class=\"muted small\">/ month per seat</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"small\">✓ Unlimited requests</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"small\">✓ 1 TB bandwidth included</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"small\">✓ Unlimited team seats</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"small\">✓ Priority support, 4h response</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"small\">✓ 90-day log retention</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"small\">✓ SSO / SAML &amp; audit logs</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"small\">✓ 99.99% SLA &amp; dedicated infra</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-block\">Contact sales</button>\n      <p class=\"muted small center\">Volume discounts from 25 seats</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n    <h4 class=\"card-title\">Compare plans in detail</h4>\n    <table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr><th>Feature</th><th>Free</th><th>Pro</th><th>Team</th></tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td>Requests per day</td><td class=\"num\">1,000</td><td class=\"num\">100,000</td><td class=\"num\">Unlimited</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Bandwidth</td><td class=\"num\">5 GB</td><td class=\"num\">100 GB</td><td class=\"num\">1 TB+</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Team seats</td><td class=\"num\">2</td><td class=\"num\">10</td><td class=\"num\">Unlimited</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Log retention</td><td class=\"num\">7 days</td><td class=\"num\">30 days</td><td class=\"num\">90 days</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Custom domains</td><td><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"badge\">✓</span></td><td><span class=\"badge\">✓</span></td></tr>\n        <tr><td>SSO / SAML</td><td><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"badg